  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I2Iecc2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"331\"></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customizable-elytra-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.12.2 移植版&nbsp;by jbredwards</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">允許像皮革護甲和盾牌一樣，對鞘翅進行染色和放置旗幟圖案</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/65w3fye.gif\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nabKwkn.gif\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iRmFHSt.gif\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">1.20 新增功能：支援盔甲飾紋！</span></h3>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n9bnpIO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"349\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">額外功能與常見問題</span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可與披風搭配使用！</span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tQ75HRc.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（只需在合成時加入一張紙，即可隱藏披風在鞘翅上的顯示！）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>與發光墨囊合成，讓你的鞘翅在黑暗中發光！</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O8f3qxP.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">（在 1.16 中也支援來自 Upgrade Aquatic 和 Caves & Cliff's Backport 的發光墨囊！）</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">常見問題</h3>\n<h5><strong>此模組是否相容於其他模組新增的旗幟？</strong></h5>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">截至最新版本，以下模組已相容：Additional Banners、Rats、Ice and Fire、Autumnity、Buzzier Bees、Neapolitan、Alex's Mobs 以及 Penguin-Lib</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如果我自訂鞘翅，附魔和自訂名稱會保留嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是的，自訂鞘翅時不會遺失任何已做出的更改。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>如何移除自訂效果？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">手持鞘翅並右鍵點擊裝滿水的煉藥鍋，即可將其恢復為原版狀態！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">影片</span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5AR9YOdEBL4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p9s6mwcfayU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（若時間點無效，請跳轉至 3:06！）</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
